			"notes": "The latest build of GTMoreMachine for Minecraft 1.20.1.\nPlease report any [issues](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/issues).\n## What's Changed since v1.6.0-1.20.1\n### Added\n\n- Update v2 to latest 1.20.1 by @QiuYe-123 in [#110](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/110)\n- Updata GTM by @QiuYe-123 in [#112](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/112)\n- Updata libs version by @QiuYe-123 in [#116](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/116)\n- SeparativeLanguageGeneration by @QiuYe-123 in [#128](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/128)\n- Fix GitHub workflows for 1.21.1 by @QiuYe-123 in [#138](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/138)\n- Sorting out the data generation section by @QiuYe-123 in [#148](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/148)\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fix programmable cover with simple tiered machine by @QiuYe-123 in [#113](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/113)\n- Fix GTM Refactor BE interaction methods bugs by @QiuYe-123 in [#115](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/115)\n- Fix get auto build setting by @QiuYe-123 in [#120](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/120)\n- this指向修复，创造激光修复 by @QiuYe-123 in [#122](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/122)\n- Fix PartMachine with v8 by @QiuYe-123 in [#124](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/124)\n- 修复ProgrammableCircuitHandler初始化时machine为null by @QiuYe-123 in [#126](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/126)\n- Fix GTM remove IMachineLife Errore by @QiuYe-123 in [#127](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/127)\n- fix NPE by @QiuYe-123 in [#130](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/130)\n- fix pos =null by @QiuYe-123 in [#131](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/131)\n- Fallback null by @QiuYe-123 in [#132](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/132)\n- Fix AdvancedTerminalBehavior DemolitionMode by @QiuYe-123 in [#133](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/133)\n- Fix filterSort NPE by @QiuYe-123 in [#135](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/135)\n- Fix wireless capacity sync for demodulation hub by @QiuYe-123 in [#142](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/142)\n- [1.20.1] Remove unsupported quiet compiler argument by @QiuYe-123 in [#144](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/144)\n- tooltip fix for huge buses by @LeoDreamer2004 in [#151](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/151)\n- Fix some misc bugs on multiblock parts by @LeoDreamer2004 in [#153](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/153)\n\n### Changed\n\n- Lang Refactor by @QiuYe-123 in [#87](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/87)\n- 整合中文数据生成 by @QiuYe-123 in [#98](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/98)\n- Wireless Refactor by @QiuYe-123 in [#119](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/119)\n- Remove GTCEu 的资源文件的复制品 by @QiuYe-123 in [#123](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/123)\n- Advanced Terminal Behavior Refactor by @QiuYe-123 in [#104](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/104)\n- PerformanceOptimization by @QiuYe-123 in [#134](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/134)\n- Fix GitHub workflows for 1.21.1 by @QiuYe-123 in [#138](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/138)\n- [1.20.1] Backport shared time-stat and UI formatting fixes by @QiuYe-123 in [#145](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/145)\n\n\n- Updata1.20.1 v2 to latest by @QiuYe-123 in [#96](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/96)\n- Updata 1.20.1 v2 to latest by @QiuYe-123 in [#99](https://github.com/QiuYe-123/GregTech-MoreMachine/pull/99)\n\n..."
